<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Chocolates reports surge in Q3 net.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Chocolates reports surge in Q3 net.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's Compania Nacional de Chocolates S.A., a leading holding of the powerful Sindicato Antioqueno conglomerate, reported the following third quarter results.</p>
<p>Net profit 37.86 billion pesos, up 24 percent from Q3 1995</p>
<p>Operating profit 20.0 billion pesos vs 17.34 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: Net profit figure for Q3 1995 was not available. Figures are unconsolidated and subject to approval by Colombia's Securities Superintendency.</p>
<p>-- Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944</p>
</text>
